# Backup must restore BYTE-IDENTICAL files.
# Skill packages in this library have mixed encodings on purpose: some files carry
# a UTF-8 BOM, some use CRLF, some LF (measured: reverse-trace had 1 BOM file,
# 57 CRLF, 154 LF).  Git must not "helpfully" normalise any of it.
* -text

# Explicitly mark binaries so no diff/merge driver ever touches them.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.onnx binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.pyc  binary
